      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2050577190,
      "version": 82,
      "versionNonce": 891309606,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793829279451,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> A Docker Image is a read-only template used to create Docker containers.\n-> Contains application code, dependencies, libraries, runtime and configurations.\n-> It is built using a Dockerfile.\n-> Images are immutable (cannot be directly modified).\n-> A single image can create multiple containers.\n-> Images can be stored and shared through registries like Docker Hub.",
      "rawText": "-> A Docker Image is a read-only template used to create Docker containers.\n-> Contains application code, dependencies, libraries, runtime and configurations.\n-> It is built using a Dockerfile.\n-> Images are immutable (cannot be directly modified).\n-> A single image can create multiple containers.\n-> Images can be stored and shared through registries like Docker Hub.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> A Docker Image is a read-only template used to create Docker containers.\n-> Contains application code, dependencies, libraries, runtime and configurations.\n-> It is built using a Dockerfile.\n-> Images are immutable (cannot be directly modified).\n-> A single image can create multiple containers.\n-> Images can be stored and shared through registries like Docker Hub.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    },
    {
      "id": "jihUfxUh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -623.6000366210938,
      "y": 785.5999450683594,
      "width": 619.2154541015625,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 867053798,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 632777318,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793829363330,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> A Docker Container is a running or stopped instance of a Docker Image.\n-> It provides an isolated environment to execute an application.\n-> Has its own filesystem, processes, network and configurations.\n-> Containers are lightweight and portable.\n-> Multiple containers can be created from the same image.\n-> Containers can be started, stopped, restarted and deleted.\n-> Changes made inside a container are stored in its writable layer and are lost\n when the container is deleted (unless persistent storage is used).",
      "rawText": "-> A Docker Container is a running or stopped instance of a Docker Image.\n-> It provides an isolated environment to execute an application.\n-> Has its own filesystem, processes, network and configurations.\n-> Containers are lightweight and portable.\n-> Multiple containers can be created from the same image.\n-> Containers can be started, stopped, restarted and deleted.\n-> Changes made inside a container are stored in its writable layer and are lost\n when the container is deleted (unless persistent storage is used).",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> A Docker Container is a running or stopped instance of a Docker Image.\n-> It provides an isolated environment to execute an application.\n-> Has its own filesystem, processes, network and configurations.\n-> Containers are lightweight and portable.\n-> Multiple containers can be created from the same image.\n-> Containers can be started, stopped, restarted and deleted.\n-> Changes made inside a container are stored in its writable layer and are lost\n when the container is deleted (unless persistent storage is used).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "hasTextLink": false
    }
  ],
